<title>LEBANON: Israeli planes raid south Lebanon.</title>
<headline>Israeli planes raid south Lebanon.</headline>
<dateline>RASHAYA 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli planes raided suspected Moslem guerrillas positionS in south Lebanon on Monday, security sources said.</p>
<p>They said two planes fired a total of four rockets at Mashghara hills, a stronghold of the pro-Iranian Hizbollah group south of Syrian-controlled Bekaa valley.</p>
</text>
